OL,3,AHarry and Meghan change children's
OL,4,Aschool over security concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,7,Fchanged their children's school only
OL,8,Fdays after they first started over
OL,9,Fsecurity concerns about the school run.
OL,11,FThe schools' names have not been
OL,12,Fdisclosed, but it is understood that
OL,13,Fthe Sussexes' private security team had
OL,14,Fbeen concerned that the distance and
OL,15,Fthe heavy traffic on the original
OL,16,Fschool run route had made it difficult
OL,17,Fto make secure.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
