OL,3,AHarry and Meghan change children's
OL,4,Aschool over security concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA source close to the couple said: "The
OL,7,Fparents remain extremely grateful to
OL,8,Fall the teachers and staff for the
OL,9,Flove, care and effort they have shown
OL,10,Ftheir family.
OL,12,F"This decision should in no way be
OL,13,Finterpreted as a reflection on the
OL,14,Fschool or the exceptional care the
OL,15,Fchildren have received there."
